serve every existing payload/error/Cause expectation. A Boolean branch assertion alone does not supply an expected payload, error or Cause; do not invent one or rewrite a compound predicate as a single structural assertion. utils.assertSuccess: Use for hand-rolled-data-assertion findings (EV006, candidate class hand-rolled-data-assertion) when a genuine Result must succeed with an expected value. Review assertion polarity and preserve every existing payload/error/Cause expectation. A Boolean branch assertion alone does not supply an expected payload, error or Cause; do not invent one or rewrite a compound predicate as a single structural assertion. utils.assertFailure: Use for hand-rolled-data-assertion findings (EV006, candidate class hand-rolled-data-assertion) when a genuine Result must fail with an expected error. Review assertion polarity and preserve every existing payload/error/Cause expectation. A Boolean branch assertion alone does not supply an expected payload, error or Cause; do not invent one or rewrite a compound predicate as a single structural assertion. utils.assertExitFailure: Use for result-outcome-assertion findings (EV005, candidate class result-outcome-assertion) after replacing Effect.result with Effect.exit, or for hand-rolled-data-assertion findings (EV006, candidate class hand-rolled-data-assertion), when an Exit must fail with an expected Cause. Review assertion polarity and preserve every existing payload/error/Cause expectation. A Boolean branch assertion alone does not supply an expected payload, error or Cause; do not invent one or rewrite a compound predicate as a single structural assertion. utils.assertExitSuccess: Use for result-outcome-assertion findings (EV005, candidate class result-outcome-assertion) after replacing Effect.result with Effect.exit, or for hand-rolled-data-assertion findings (EV006, candidate class hand-rolled-data-assertion), when an Exit must succeed with an expected value. Review assertion polarity and preserv